# `declaration:concurrency` — the `parallel` header modifier (SPEC §4.5). A maximal run of
# consecutive `parallel`-marked tests forms one concurrently-executed batch, so these two meet
# inside `arrival-server.mjs`'s rendezvous. Its twin `pair-sequential.tflw` differs by one word per
# header and nothing else.

test "first half of the rendezvous" parallel
  api GET /gate
  expect status equals 200

test "second half of the rendezvous" parallel
  api GET /gate
  expect status equals 200
